   Mallam, Steven, Univ South Eastern Norway, Fac Technol Nat Sci \& Maritime Sci, Notodden, Norway.
   Nazir, Salman, Univ South Eastern Norway, Dept Maritime Operat, Training \& Assessment, Notodden, Norway.
   Mallam, Steven, Mem Univ Newfoundland, Maritime Human Factors, Fisheries \& Marine Inst, St John, NF, Canada.},
