   Zhang, Mengyu; Bae, Woongkyoo, Chung Ang Univ, Dept Urban Design \& Studies, Seoul 06974, South Korea.
   Kim, Jeeyeop, Ajou Univ, Dept Architecture, Suwon 16499, South Korea.},
